WEBVTT

NOTE
Galbadian fighter squadron. Jets fly in formation, a missile's targeting sensor locks on, then the squadron races low over the ocean toward the coast.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Galbadian fighter jets fly in tight formation, afterburners blazing against the clouds.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The jets streak over the ocean, trailing white vapor across blue water.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Close-up of a missile's red targeting eye. The sensor locks on to its target.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The squadron races low over the waves, mountains rising on the horizon ahead.
